      "font_size": 44,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 49,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "A longer life",
        "for your thinking."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-159df2dba4b9",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 287,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 23.2,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA begins with a simple gap: we say more",
        "to AI, but it can still be difficult to return to",
        "our own words."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1db97a7b9d37",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-390.011",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 426.6,
      "width": null,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 9.5,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "01 / A DESIGN PRINCIPLE"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c22e6fac9b28",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-390.012",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 468.6,
      "width": 337,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 36,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 42,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Not more to maintain.",
        "More to continue."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-a47ac8d57fde",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 578.6,
      "width": 331,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 23.2,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "We are building a personal input, thought",
        "and context system around expressions",
        "you already produce. The archive should",
        "be useful before you have organized a",
        "single topic."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-f2e6662a63c0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-en-390.014",
